 "id": "297-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "That way, you can have your code, documentation, and any other relevant resources open simultaneously.",
  "One of the key things we do is add the '@timer_class' decorator from the 'pedantic' module to all our classes.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything at all.",
  "I want you to set up two monitors for coding from now on.",
  "Having two monitors allows you to spread out your work and easily reference multiple documents, code files, or tools simultaneously.",
  "It reduces the need for constant alt-tabbing and helps you stay focused on the task at hand.",
  "It might take a little time to adjust and figure out the layout that works best for you, but trust me, it's worth it.",
  "Firstly, I want you to start using a single monitor when coding.",
  "It helps with focus and ensures you're not overwhelmed with information.",
  "Going forward, I want you to end all your function names with '_a'.",
  "Consistency is key in coding, and I find that this helps keep things organized and readable.",
  "We're a team, and I'm here to support you.",
  "Assure the interviewee that their feedback is anonymous and will be used constructively.",
  "Standardization can be useful to ensure that certain key areas are covered, but it's also important to allow for flexibility and adaptation based on the unique circumstances of each employee's departure.",
  "Always happy to help.",
  "Remember, the key is to create a safe space, show genuine curiosity, and demonstrate that their feedback is valued and will lead to positive change."
 ],
